---
import '../styles/site.css';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');
const path=(value='')=>`${base}/${value}`;
const features=[
  {icon:'◷',title:'Your mosque’s prayer times',text:'See the next congregation and the full schedule published by your mosque. Choose reminders that work for your day.'},
  {icon:'▦',title:'A community worth showing up for',text:'Follow mosque activities and calendar categories, from Jamat events to your auxiliary’s gatherings.'},
  {icon:'✧',title:'A little learning, every day',text:'Open your learning library, flashcards and assignments using the account you already signed in with.'},
  {icon:'⌖',title:'Arrive. Connect. Reflect.',text:'Use optional automatic arrival detection or check in yourself. Review your visits, with privacy controls close at hand.'},
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="Masjidee brings your mosque’s prayer times, activities and learning into one calm place. Discover the Android pilot and read the user guides."/><meta name="theme-color" content="#104f46"/><meta property="og:title" content="Masjidee — Your mosque, a little closer."/><meta property="og:description" content="Prayer times. Community. Learning. One place to feel connected."/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content="https://saada1999.github.io/masjidee-site/"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://saada1999.github.io/masjidee-site/"/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={path('masjidee-mark.svg')}/><title>Masjidee — Your mosque, a little closer.</title></head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="header"><nav class="nav wrap" aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="brand" href={path()}><img src={path('masjidee-mark.svg')} width="42" height="42" alt=""/>Masjidee<span class="brand-note">MY MOSQUE</span></a><div class="nav-links"><a href="#features">Features</a><a href={path('docs/')}>User guides</a><a class="button button-small" href={path('get-app/')}>Join the pilot <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></nav></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> A LITTLE CLOSER. EVERY DAY.</p><h1>Your mosque,<br/>a little <em>closer.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Prayer times, community and learning.<br class="desktop-break"/> A calmer way to stay connected to your mosque.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={path('get-app/')}>Explore the Android pilot <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href={path('docs/')}>Find your way around <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="pilot-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> Android pilot available by invitation · iPhone planned</p><div class="hero-bottom"><span class="small-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p>Made for the moments<br/><strong>that bring us together.</strong></p></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><div class="arch" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="orbit orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="floating-label"><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span> More connection. Less searching.</div><div class="phone" aria-label="Illustrative Masjidee screen, not a live prayer schedule"><div class="phone-camera" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="phone-content"><div class="phone-heading"><span aria-hidden="true">☰</span><strong>Masjidee</strong><span class="phone-avatar" aria-hidden="true">M</span></div><p class="phone-mosque">EXAMPLE MOSQUE <span aria-hidden="true">⌖</span></p><div class="prayer-preview"><p>NEXT CONGREGATION</p><h2>Maghrib</h2><div class="sample-time">5:20 <small>PM</small></div><div class="preview-rule"></div><span>All prayer times <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span><span class="preview-in-out">In &nbsp; · &nbsp; Out</span></div><div class="preview-heading"><strong>A moment to reflect</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><div class="sermon-preview"><span class="sermon-art" aria-hidden="true">☾</span><div><small>FRIDAY SERMON</small><strong>Listen. Reflect. Reconnect.</strong><span>Urdu & English · Audio & video</span></div></div><div class="preview-heading"><strong>At your mosque</strong><small>Today & tomorrow</small></div><div class="event-preview"><div>21<small>NOV</small></div><p><strong>A time to come together</strong><span>Community activities</span></p></div><div class="phone-tabs" aria-hidden="true"><span class="selected">⌂<small>Home</small></span><span>◷<small>Prayers</small></span><span>▦<small>Events</small></span><span>▤<small>Learn</small></span></div></div></div><p class="visual-caption">An illustrative preview. Find actual times in your mosque’s schedule.</p></div></section>
<div class="principles"><div class="wrap"><span>YOUR MOSQUE. YOUR RHYTHM.</span><p>Published by your community</p><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p>Privacy controls in your hands</p><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p>Learning, always within reach</p></div></div>
<section class="section wrap" id="features"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">ONE APP. EVERYDAY CONNECTION.</p><h2>Less looking around.<br/><em>More belonging.</em></h2><p>Built with Ahmadi Muslim communities in mind.<br/>Thoughtful tools for your everyday connection to the mosque.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">{features.map((f,index)=><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-top"><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{f.icon}</span><span class="feature-number">0{index+1}</span></div><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>{f.text}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="reflection"><div class="wrap reflection-inner"><div class="reflection-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>☾</span><div class="reflection-arch"></div><div class="reflection-line"></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">A MOMENT FOR YOURSELF</p><h2>Make room<br/>for <em>reflection.</em></h2><p>Find the latest two Friday sermons with Urdu and English listening and viewing options when the official media links are available. Or open the Qibla finder before prayer.</p><a class="text-link light-link" href={path('docs/guides/learning/')}>Explore sermons & learning <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap help-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FRIENDLY PLACE TO START</p><h2>A little guidance.<br/><em>Whenever you need it.</em></h2><p>From choosing your mosque to understanding phone permissions, our guides take you one step at a time.</p><a class="button" href={path('docs/')}>Open the user guides <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="guide-links"><a href={path('docs/guides/getting-started/')}><span><small>01 · FIRST STEPS</small>Make yourself at home</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href={path('docs/guides/check-ins/')}><span><small>02 · WHEN YOU ARRIVE</small>Check-ins, explained</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href={path('docs/guides/troubleshooting/')}><span><small>03 · A HELPING HAND</small>Something not working?</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
<section class="pilot-banner wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">GROWING WITH OUR COMMUNITY</p><h2>Help shape Masjidee.</h2><p>We’re learning with a small Android pilot. Your experience helps make it better.</p></div><a class="button button-cream" href={path('get-app/')}>About the pilot <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
</main><footer class="footer wrap"><div><a class="brand" href={path()}><img src={path('masjidee-mark.svg')} width="34" height="34" alt=""/>Masjidee</a><p>Your mosque. A little closer.</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href={path('docs/')}>Documentation</a><a href={path('docs/guides/privacy/')}>Privacy & permissions</a><a href={path('support/')}>Support</a><a href="https://github.com/saada1999/masjidee-site">Website source →</a></nav><small>An independent community project. Sermon links point to official Alislam sources.</small></footer>
</body></html>
